# --- Publisher PDFs: keep locally, never commit to this public repo ---
# Journal PDFs (Nature/Science/etc.) are downloaded for reference while writing
# posts. Redistributing them here would be a copyright violation.
# Own/authored PDFs (CV, etc.) live in assets/pdf/ and stay tracked.
*.pdf
!assets/pdf/*.pdf

# --- Local scratch: not part of the site build ---
# Structure/dataset files used while writing posts. Readers fetch their own
# copies (e.g. sc.datasets.pbmc3k(), RCSB), so these stay out of the repo.
# Root-level only for .pdb, so a structure can still be published under assets/.
/*.pdb
data/
